      "zh": {
        "title": "歐洲航空安全總署擴大 A380 翼樑檢查 新增8架",
        "summary": "EASA 將另8架 A380 納入翼樑檢查，最遲須於2027年1月31日前完成。",
        "body": [
          "歐洲航空安全總署發布適航指令2026-0216，取代6月發布的緊急指令，自11月18日生效。新增的8架空中巴士 A380 須檢查機翼中翼樑是否出現裂紋，期限為2027年1月31日。",
          "依航空媒體對照指令序號與機隊資料，新增對象為阿聯酋航空7架與阿提哈德航空1架。指令所列檢查對象合計24架。"
        ]
      },
      "en": {
        "title": "EASA adds eight A380s to wing spar inspection order",
        "summary": "An airworthiness directive adds eight Airbus A380s to the inspection list, with checks due by January 31, 2027.",
        "body": [
          "EASA’s airworthiness directive 2026-0216 took effect on November 18 and supersedes a June emergency directive. Eight newly listed Airbus A380s must undergo checks for cracking in their wing mid spars by January 31, 2027.",
          "Aviation publications matched the newly listed serial numbers to seven Emirates jets and one Etihad Airways jet. The directive covers 24 aircraft in total."
        ]
      },
